WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.373 --> 00:00:03.873
Unit nineteen. Motorbike and Helmet Safety!

2
00:00:04.837 --> 00:00:08.484
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.534 --> 00:00:12.385
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.435 --> 00:00:17.145
Today we learn about Motorbike and Helmet Safety. Let's go!

5
00:00:18.105 --> 00:00:21.572
Helmet. Say it with me. Helmet!

6
00:00:25.099 --> 00:00:28.966
Motorbike. Say it with me. Motorbike!

7
00:00:32.461 --> 00:00:35.661
Strap. Say it with me. Strap!

8
00:00:39.168 --> 00:00:43.068
Passenger. Say it with me. Passenger!

9
00:00:46.561 --> 00:00:49.861
Speed. Say it with me. Speed!

10
00:00:53.365 --> 00:00:56.681
Road. Say it with me. Road!

11
00:01:00.181 --> 00:01:04.098
Head injury. Say it with me. Head injury!

12
00:01:07.581 --> 00:01:10.848
Law. Say it with me. Law!

13
00:01:14.386 --> 00:01:25.316
On a motorbike, every passenger must wear a helmet with the strap fastened. A helmet greatly lowers the risk of a serious head injury. Riders should keep a safe speed and follow road law.

14
00:01:25.366 --> 00:01:26.583
I can do that too!

15
00:01:27.953 --> 00:01:32.967
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:33.017 --> 00:01:34.133
Strap!

17
00:01:34.816 --> 00:01:40.023
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:40.073 --> 00:01:41.250
Head injury!

19
00:01:42.316 --> 00:01:48.319
Did you know? A helmet that is not strapped on can fall off in a crash and give no protection!

20
00:01:48.369 --> 00:01:50.481
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:51.878 --> 00:01:59.863
Think and answer. Why must the helmet strap be fastened?

22
00:01:59.913 --> 00:02:01.063
Great answer!

23
00:02:02.187 --> 00:02:07.195
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:07.245 --> 00:02:09.907
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

